  "2026-08-20T20:11:36.876Z","harness:codex","Decision evidence: the prior global assertion was saturated at total blocks=243. Three evidence:pm-c90tfh rows raise total blocks to 246 while the derived uncited population remains 243 and the evidence partition is 3; this preserves both properties without headroom."
  "2026-08-20T21:38:57.211Z","harness:codex","Review clarification: 243 is the historical total ceiling, not the current uncited count. The live SDK evaluation after the partition measures edges-blocks=205, blocks-uncited=202, and blocks-evidence-cited=3. Retaining 243 on edges-blocks bounds total growth while the 202 ceiling and 3 floor independently protect provenance semantics."
